  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u1-v1",
      "text": "‘宗庙制度，历代都难以议定，因此要查求礼经，以阐明旧例。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "bbe25d49ae044fe4f3fa1b4cfff5230e826646b5e3196a9ad703eb749bddbd92",
      "originalEnd": 21,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 0,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u2-v1",
      "text": "谨按《尚书·舜典》说：“正月上日，在文祖之庙接受尧所交付的政权。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "92e2fbd6ecdca653ffdd7581c0e275c402f1f3db22920112dcb8c0146a9afa9a",
      "originalEnd": 42,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 21,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u3-v1",
      "text": "这是尧的庙，但还未记载庙的数目。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "13dbea4e73359ab01bc09e0bbbd07e63eb5c3d32ae98a023f8383d8fc17fd17a",
      "originalEnd": 56,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 42,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u4-v1",
      "text": "又按《郊祀录》，夏设五庙，商设六庙，周设七庙。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "639eb694df73fbadd63497982c073031a07288928d8f31eabf3db52d6a55e141",
      "originalEnd": 77,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 56,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u5-v1",
      "text": "汉初在郡国建立祖宗庙，共计一百六十七处。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f593ca4564396de8bec3d650be3dd9c3ea811e1f9a2544e897149789df47ac3e",
      "originalEnd": 97,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 77,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u6-v1",
      "text": "后汉光武中兴后，另设六庙。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f2e02ba0dcd9d27131d20ddbe3a8ca77a34ea6b70eed6a948e733ff37fcb6bee",
      "originalEnd": 110,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 97,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u7-v1",
      "text": "魏明帝起初设亲庙四座，后来重新商议，依周法设七庙。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "5c7e8f38e461f27fa5e95e9f0ad7c7702a8f2666e32447c6ef944120b80cca12",
      "originalEnd": 130,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 110,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u8-v1",
      "text": "晋武帝接受禅让，起初设六庙，后来改设七庙。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "7c9e4e3506052153dcc5ef343b97eca43163efce653d4e07d409a7c63103cf61",
      "originalEnd": 146,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 130,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u9-v1",
      "text": "宋武帝起初设六庙，齐朝也设六庙。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "80050c5ea48bd854299f427bfdc5dce1fb81cee6d1b3f91f0d7c56836a605df7",
      "originalEnd": 161,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 146,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u10-v1",
      "text": "隋文帝最初受命，设亲庙四座，到大业元年，炀帝想遵周法，议设七庙，随后隋朝传禅于唐。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "9245ac072306e1eff96bbe232c1bb60a8cf14801b584f4a4cbc277ac92e100cb",
      "originalEnd": 198,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 161,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u11-v1",
      "text": "武德元年六月四日，开始在长安设四庙。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "1d33eb4f9a2a950d252d551cb11cafc64e1c48c4d4bfcde1bd02648624bc4d95",
      "originalEnd": 215,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 198,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u12-v1",
      "text": "到贞观九年，命有关部门详细议论庙制，于是设七庙。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "4620c1e58dbf36fbf7a9ecc53caf219c7dec4dd4b2bd74139875a713f45a6d7f",
      "originalEnd": 234,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 215,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u13-v1",
      "text": "到开元十一年以后，创设九庙。又按《礼记·丧服小记》说：“王者以禘祭祭祀其祖先所自出的远祖，以自己的祖先配祭，并立四庙。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "2ed501a411e54688c71d5e7093fc07daced9a1a30787e827bd2f56febab726e5",
      "originalEnd": 279,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 234,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u14-v1",
      "text": "郑玄注说：“从高祖以下到父亲四代，就是亲庙。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "4f388d0d8e714701f42f99ed19436260e6a486e32561e15e1fe3965ad4d97db4",
      "originalEnd": 299,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 279,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u15-v1",
      "text": "再立始祖为不迁之庙，便是五庙。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "a2467b0557fbf84eea5baea1f32dabb99321f61c6471de11f48d9944af96b566",
      "originalEnd": 315,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 299,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u16-v1",
      "text": "又按《礼记》的《祭法》《王制》，以及《孔子家语》《春秋谷梁传》，都说：“天子七庙，诸侯五庙，大夫三庙，士一庙。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "4f4489b17025d81ccff7104020a4c4d9154d22283bf512c8432b3cdc07a00cf8",
      "originalEnd": 359,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 315,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u17-v1",
      "text": "这是每等递减两庙的意思。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "f1d45a9ea0625dcae3c2eaca48e770ca112630f83ce86a08e25ce1dbfca9721a",
      "originalEnd": 368,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 359,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u18-v1",
      "text": "又按《尚书·咸有一德》说：“七世之庙，可以观察其德。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "9c8e477692836325cb21f178a73de660ce79067c550c97a6ed2cfe12c5ca2b5f",
      "originalEnd": 390,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 368,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u19-v1",
      "text": "又按《疑义》说：“天子设七庙，或四庙，都是有意义的。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "d7e59f1bbdd6db46f2051dee00d26f4bb693437d451c2226e7d2a5164e90cac2",
      "originalEnd": 414,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 390,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u20-v1",
      "text": "所谓四庙，从父亲到高祖，高祖以上亲属世次已远，所以有四庙之礼。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "0f26ffb8473022e72afd50d69c9a4ca9b59c1dd467fb39e25aa0a87461939b26",
      "originalEnd": 436,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 414,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u21-v1",
      "text": "至于设七庙，是因为自古圣王以有功者为祖、有德者为宗，再奉立始祖，在四亲庙之外，或因祖有功，或因宗有德，不拘固定数目，所以有五庙、六庙或七庙，使后代子孙观察他们的功德。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "87e7a8272fdbb5b7ce5d04de7ae716d2a65de0fab05bec6fdff221c241d68bad",
      "originalEnd": 502,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 436,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u22-v1",
      "text": "因此《尚书》说：“七世之庙，可以观察其德。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "0b465524a9b8f7e3cba1275b8a01bfd57b2220dc346124fd858036c6b36249d8",
      "originalEnd": 518,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 502,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u23-v1",
      "text": "（接前句）这就是上述的道理了。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "d0a4e93031846e8b8a27086ee9bff40df623f7bbf8d67299b921ea756ad7ce5b",
      "originalEnd": 520,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [
        "底本将句末语气词“矣”单独以句号断开；此译接续上一句，表达归结、确认的语气，不另添史事。"
      ],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 518,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u24-v1",
      "text": "又按周舍说：“自江左以来，晋、宋、齐、梁、陈相继，大多设七庙。”",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "1641852e0ccfdfea51484bb9b14f1fdc8cdf2b5ff431d6313dc9431b7c07c9f8",
      "originalEnd": 551,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 520,
      "originalSha256": "34cce902a04c8958bf3492ad31d70abc9954739e0258f4311bd12b607dddc767",
      "originalRevision": 1,
      "parentTranslationId": "1460",
      "parentTranslationSha256": "78ad000135cbeb844950b56b5ccea6bc2f89d0fdd29845d1261498e77846fead",
      "parentTranslationVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-huiyao-v002-p55-u25-v1",
      "text": "如今段颙等参详，只有设七庙或四庙，都能讲通道理。",
      "origin": "ai",
      "version": 1,
      "textSha256": "12899605285d9367a4eeb1875b85932c83797ca8882d15371563938273b69feb",
      "originalEnd": 570,
      "paragraphId": "huiyao-v002-p55",
      "reviewNotes": [],
      "humanReviewed": false,
      "originalStart": 551,
